{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >In order to launch the mod make sure that Steam version of original <strong>DOOM 3 </strong>and <strong>DOOM 3: Resurrection of Evil</strong> is installed</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978420/extras/ed8c9fb56b22186bfd86ee71c8277f2d.avif?t=1759914873\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978420/extras_big/ed8c9fb56b22186bfd86ee71c8277f2d.avif?t=1759914873 width=1560 height=644 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Waking up on Mars with no memory and a wound you can\u2019t explain, you begin a desperate search for answers - about yourself, your past, and the catastrophe looming over two worlds. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You soon meet Samantha Miles, an agent of a sketchy world-wide conglomerate, who claims to know you. As she helps you with your identity, you aid her in the quest to find a long lost friend and missing agent. When the original events of DOOM 3 unfold, the two of you must scramble for safety while still tracking down the missing agent and your identity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978420/extras/d0871979bc6d9a3740bccc8a28c71e77.avif?t=1759914873\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978420/extras_big/d0871979bc6d9a3740bccc8a28c71e77.avif?t=1759914873 width=1560 height=644 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Haunted by fragmented memories and guided by the familiar voice of a girl named Lee, you\u2019ll unearth bittersweet flashbacks, and fight for survival as a mysterious and deadly invasion spreads from the shadows of Mars.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a new set of maps, enemies and story for the beloved old DOOM 3 game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978420/extras/d1f25436ac909d208a0f95440f0cbffa.avif?t=1759914873\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978420/extras_big/d1f25436ac909d208a0f95440f0cbffa.avif?t=1759914873 width=1560 height=644 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is divided into 4 episodes of varying length.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Episode 1: Overdue</strong> <br>Released December 3 2018 <br>\u00a0 <br><strong>Episode 2: Disruption</strong> <br>Released September 27 2020 <br>\u00a0 <br><strong>Episode 3: Collapse</strong> <br>Released June 2 2024 <br>\u00a0 <br><strong>Episode 4</strong> <br>To be released</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original story set in the DOOM 3 universe</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original voice acting</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >19 Original maps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 episodes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New and improved shotgun</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 new enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Updated weapons and enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Improved and fast paced combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Environmental puzzles</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978420/extras/8986ce90b2f18e607e271f9264c8faa1.avif?t=1759914873\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978420/extras_big/8986ce90b2f18e607e271f9264c8faa1.avif?t=1759914873 width=1560 height=644 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.aka